|:-------|:-----------|:--------------------|:--------------------|:---------|
| abc    | x1         | 2012-02-07 00:00:00 | 2012-02-11 00:00:00 | abc      |
| abc    | x2         | 2012-02-08 00:00:00 | 2012-02-13 00:00:00 | def      |
| abc    | [Person_1] | 2012-02-08 00:00:00 | 2012-02-17 00:00:00 | nan      |
| def    | y1         | 2012-02-06 00:00:00 | 2012-02-20 00:00:00 | nan      |
| def    | y2         | 2012-02-06 00:00:00 | 2012-02-21 00:00:00 | nan      |
