| Entered Employment/Education                                          | 0.73         | 0.66         | 0.6575       | 0.7339       | 0.73         |
| Attained HSD/GED or Career Technical Training Certificate             | 0.53         | 0.55         | 0.606        | 0.6437       | 0.6489       |
